Taxonomy's ONNX image variant includes the quantized multilingual embedding model
sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2.

Model publisher: Sentence Transformers
Source: https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers/paraphrase-multilingual-MiniLM-L12-v2
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory).

The upstream model and tokenizer bytes are unmodified. The ONNX export is named
model.onnx for the local loader. MODEL_PROVENANCE.txt records the immutable source
revision, upstream export path and SHA-256 digests of the distributed files.
